stateDiagram-v2
    title PFS Foundation Workflow State Machine (DIA-008)

    [*] --> Draft : Create Stage Instance
    Draft --> Ready : Validate Preconditions (Guards Pass)
    Ready --> Running : Start Execution (Lease Tasks)
    
    state Running {
        [*] --> TaskPlanning
        TaskPlanning --> AgentExecuting : Dispatch Task
        AgentExecuting --> OutputValidation : Task Output
        OutputValidation --> [*] : All Tasks Complete
    }

    Running --> InReview : All Tasks Successful
    Running --> Failed : Error (Timeout / API Crash)
    Running --> Blocked : Quality Gate Violated (Critical Finding)

    Failed --> Suspended : Max Retries Exceeded
    Suspended --> Ready : Manual Operator Compensation

    Blocked --> Ready : Remediate Finding / Issue Waiver

    InReview --> Approved : Human Explicit Sign-off (Ed25519)
    InReview --> Rejected : Reviewer Rejection
    Rejected --> Draft : Revise Inputs & Tasks

    Approved --> Completed : Seal Stage Checkpoint
    Completed --> [*] : Advance to Next Pipeline Stage
